  <content>
    <section>
      <title>Getting Ready for Unit 1</title>
      <para>To be ready for this unit, you need to be able to:</para>
      <list>
        <item>Solve linear equations using a general strategy.</item>
        <item>Classify equations.</item>
        <item>Identify points on a graph.</item>
      </list>
      <para>Next, you will answer some questions that will help you see how ready you are for this unit. If you need help, some mini-lessons will help you brush up on anything you need to work on.</para>
    </section>
  </content>
</document>